                "message": "🐛 Keep the citar preload from being thrown away by the frame width\n\nThe fields citar parses depended on the layout (the tags column only exists\non a wide frame), so a preload made at another width was read again by the\nfirst call. Sort the list and always include tags and keywords. Add\nsp-citations-preload-explain to say why a file is not ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCyfpEM7dFcJmFXN4v",
